{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id943758111"}, "name":{"label":"Airbnb need to change !"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-05-05T10:36:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"19.18"}, "id":{"label":"4105422074"}, "title":{"label":"Airbnb policy is not fair for host and guest"}, "content":{"label":"If guest book then cancel - guest will lose service fee to airbnb (which they just care abt it) and some part of money to the host depend on the flexibility if the host on cancellation. \n\nBut when host cancel the booking after got paid from guest (which i have experience 2 times already) guest will lose some money if your currency is not supported in airbnb even when they got 100% refund frm the host. For my case i lost 3.5% of the whole amount i paid to the host due to bank charge/exchange rate. Also you will have to pay higher rate for similar listing due to price rising up if the host cancel close to your arrival. Is it fair?? \n\nWe suggest Airbnb shud also have some polocyto protect guest such as if host cancel the booking due to their problem then they also have to pay some compensation to the guest. That will help guest to cover their loss also make the host to be more prudent with their listing to avoid such ridiculous cancellation issue.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"6"}}, 
