{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id523678638"}, "name":{"label":"Chung USA 2018"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-11-21T14:51:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"18.46"}, "id":{"label":"3444866309"}, "title":{"label":"Stupid security check!"}, "content":{"label":"I got my password right and got asked to verify my identity because I log in from another country. Of course I am in another country because I’m on holiday! The thing is I happened not to be able to log into my email and was almost denied entry to my airbnb house which I paid for. Other methods of verification requires me to have access to my usua SIM card, and I do not have that since I am on holiday in another country! I almost haved to go to hotel, becauce dont know address of booked apartment. Finally I got to the booked apartment only because of luck.What’s your stupid security  check!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
