{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id570106282"}, "name":{"label":"Le LaAfrica Homestay"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-10-27T08:58:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"18.43"}, "id":{"label":"3350478028"}, "title":{"label":"The fair for the host of airbnb"}, "content":{"label":"Hello Airbnb team, I’m writing this because I want to share my comment to you. We have been working really well with each other. But in a few weeks until now, I feel that you guys are having manage problem. That problem affects a lot to the benefit of the hosts. Being a host, of course you don’t want to have a bad review. We always try our best to satisfy the guests. But some of the guests used their review privilege to ask us refund money or they will write a bad review with untrue and a lot of ridiculous things. I feel that our benefits are not protected even we have many broofs on our Airbnb conversation. When I claim on Airbnb, all I get back is just “This is out of our Policy”. I wish I can meet someone who has the power and ability to solve the problem, who can judge for us in the most fair way. \nThank you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
