{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id156006498"}, "name":{"label":"tungisalive"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-08-06T21:22:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"18.31"}, "id":{"label":"3028572059"}, "title":{"label":"The app is very very far from perfection!"}, "content":{"label":"I love Airbnb but this app is absolutely horrible and actually holding our experiences back which should have been awesome because Experience is the core of the whole Airbnb business. It’s almost impossible to search for the exact place/home/host you want to see and interact with. The search tool is just horrible. The app is not stable and when you are scrolling the list of home, it would auto go back top ?!?!! Let’s start fixing it before we dive into any other stuffs.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
