{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id546286460"}, "name":{"label":"BaoVinh.Tran"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-07-13T01:59:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"18.28"}, "id":{"label":"2898518573"}, "title":{"label":"Bad Customer service"}, "content":{"label":"We booked 2 places in dalat last week, the first we paid already but when arrived the owner said that there was no more room and he did inform airbnb before. The second was dirty and the owner agreed to cancel for us. Then we had to book hotel in urgent. And now airbnb charged us the service fee?! When we complained airbnb staff just focus on service fee and make no further action or solution?! It's ridiculous! 1 star is too high for such this bad service!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
